###> paystack (online school-fee payment) ###
# Leave the secret key EMPTY to run on the built-in payment simulator, which is
# what makes the whole parent payment journey testable without real money.
# Set it (container environment, not this file) to switch to real Paystack.
# See docs/payments/PAYMENT-FLOW-DESIGN.md and App\Service\Payment\GatewayFactory.
PAYSTACK_SECRET_KEY=
PAYSTACK_PUBLIC_KEY=

# The bank Paystack issues a family's dedicated virtual account with
# (`preferred_bank`). Confirm the slug with GET /dedicated_account/providers on
# our account before changing it; unset means "use the default in the code".
# See docs/payments/VIRTUAL-ACCOUNTS-DESIGN.md.
# PAYSTACK_DVA_BANK=wema-bank
###< paystack ###
